; Which command frames of the diagnostic WHO 1001, 1004, 1005, 1013 and 1018 leave a gateway
; (*1001*WHAT*74##, *1004*WHAT*31##, *1005*WHAT*31##, *1013*WHAT*0##, *1018*WHAT*31##).
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: the same values for
; every WHO, WHAT 0..36, 40, 50, 99, 100, 255, 999..1002, 9999.
;
; Result (stock settings, two identical runs per target, 13 targets): per group below, the
; gateways that forward the frame to the bus or answer it on the event session, and the
; gateways whose daemon crashes. Gateways not named drop the frame.

